  "steps": [
    "Chop onion and pak choi. Mix mayo, honey and peanut butter in a bowl.",
    "Boil udon noodles 3 minutes; drain.",
    "Fry onion and pak choi in oil 3 minutes. Push aside; add more oil; add beef \u2014 flatten with spatula for browning.",
    "Add cumin and garlic powder; flip beef; stir everything. Add noodles.",
    "Remove from heat; add sauce; stir. Done!"
